paragraph.math:
$$\begin{array}{l}
  {S^{\prime}(t) = \frac{d}{dt}\left\lbrack \frac{5t}{t^{2} + 1} \right\rbrack = 5\frac{d}{dt}\left\lbrack \frac{t}{t^{2} + 1} \right\rbrack} \\
  {\phantom{S^{\prime}(t)} = 5\left\lbrack \frac{\left( t^{2} + 1 \right)(1) - t(2t)}{\left( t^{2} + 1 \right)^{2}} \right\rbrack} \\
  {\phantom{S^{\prime}(t)} = 5\left\lbrack \frac{t^{2} + 1 - 2t^{2}}{\left( t^{2} + 1 \right)^{2}} \right\rbrack = \frac{5\left( 1 - t^{2} \right)}{\left( t^{2} + 1 \right)^{2}}}
  \end{array}$$
